00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A wide establishing shot reveals the Galbadian Missile Base, a sprawling military installation situated in a desert landscape.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The base is dominated by massive concrete bunkers and fortified structures. Several tall silo towers rise prominently against the sky, housing intercontinental missiles.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Heavy security gates and perimeter fencing surround the entire complex. Military vehicles patrol the base grounds constantly. Armed soldiers in Galbadian uniforms stand at guard posts.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The barren desert terrain stretches around the base, with minimal vegetation. The architecture is purely functional and military in design.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Selphie's team approaches the base cautiously from a distance, preparing to infiltrate and sabotage the missiles that are targeted at Balamb and Trabia Gardens.
